-- +goose Up
-- Holiday calendar 2023–2027 (TAHLIL_REJA.md 3.3): real, not demo, events in
-- the market events log with the categories they usually push up, so price
-- jumps can be read against them and the advice can warn before them.
-- Ramazon and Qurbon hayiti follow the lunar calendar; the official date may
-- differ by a day. Notes start with "Taqvim" so the rows can be told apart.

-- +goose Down
DELETE FROM market_events WHERE kind = 'holiday' AND NOT is_demo AND note LIKE 'Taqvim%';
